Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:04:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] build(hip0025-wire): readiness overlay for trees that contain
 PR3 (harness only)

Attaches PR3's custom-readiness eligibility to every chart-v3 watcher wait,
including each ordered batch on trees that also contain PR1.

Signed-off-by: Rohit Gudi <50377477+caretak3r@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 pkg/action/wire_readiness_v3.go | 46 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 46 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 pkg/action/wire_readiness_v3.go

diff --git a/pkg/action/wire_readiness_v3.go b/pkg/action/wire_readiness_v3.go
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..47bf2f6a8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/pkg/action/wire_readiness_v3.go
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
